      "prompt": "散件：大剑、拳套、眼泪；成装：狂徒铠甲；棋盘：Ahri 2星（蓝霸符）。我现在的装备事实是什么？",
      "expected_state": {"item_components.0": "大剑", "item_components.2": "眼泪", "completed_items.0": "狂徒铠甲", "board.0.items.0": "蓝霸符"},
      "expected_tools": [], "allowed_tools": [], "expected_status": "completed"
    },
    {
      "id": "augment_001", "slice": "augments",
      "prompt": "强化符文：珠光莲花、纷乱头脑；棋盘：Ahri 2星，Sett 2星。请结合已知事实定性分析。",
      "expected_state": {"augments.0": "珠光莲花", "augments.1": "纷乱头脑"},
      "expected_tools": [], "allowed_tools": [], "expected_status": "completed"
    },
    {
      "id": "streak_001", "slice": "small_streak_context",
      "prompt": "我7级28血30金币，当前4连败；棋盘：Ahri 1星，Sett 1星；目标是4费卡，我该D吗？",
      "expected_state": {"streak.type": "loss", "streak.length": 4, "target_cost": 4},
