    {
      "id": "no_explosion_001", "slice": "champion_tool_explosion",
      "prompt": "棋盘：Ahri 2星，Sett 2星，Garen 2星，Lux 1星；备战席：Ezreal 1星，Riven 1星。概括我的棋盘和备战席。",
